yment setup are also critical.\n\n\n**Defining Project Deliverables**\n\nFocusing on the required deliverables, ensuring the generated reports meet all specified length and content requirements. Recognizing the need to include diverse technical details like diagrams, formulas, test coverage, and pipeline logs. Additionally, noting the importance of producing both a comprehensive technical report and individual contribution reports.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"where.exe git; (Get-Command git.exe -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue).Path","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\Madziva\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\qualification-verification-system","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":3000,"toolAction":"Finding git path","toolSummary":"Check git path"}}]}
