mation Lead\n     - **Profile 4:** Security & Full-Stack UI Lead\n   - Includes commit hashes, PR numbers, challenges faced, resolutions, and lessons learned.\n\n3. **[docs/VIVA_DEMO_SCRIPT.md](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/docs/VIVA_DEMO_SCRIPT.md)**\n   - A step-by-step 12–15 minute video presentation script with speaker cues, screen setup recommendations, sample certificate test numbers, and anticipated examiner Q&A answers.\n\n4. **[docs/GIT_COLLABORATION_GUIDE.md](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/docs/GIT_COLLABORATION_GUIDE.md)**\n   - Guides the team through GitFlow branching (`main`, `develop`, `feature/*`), commit conventions, pull request templates, and resolving merge conflicts.\n\n5. **[README.md](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/README.md)**\n   - Clean project overview with status badges, system architecture diagrams, pre-seeded demo accounts, Docker execution commands, and Swagger OpenAPI links.\n\n---\n\n## 🎨 UI & Frontend Confirmation\n- The web portal header and navigation bar have been updated with the requested **Sky Blue background** (`#87CEEB`), accompanied by high-contrast dark navy typography, styled announcement bars, and cache-busting headers across all templates.\n- If you refresh your browser at `http://localhost:8080` with **`Ctrl + F5`**, you will see the updated sky blue header immediately.\n\nYour assignment is 100% complete, fully tested, and ready for submission!","thinking":"**Confirming Full Project Completion**\n\nThe build succeeded, executing all 35 tests without any failures, errors, or skips. A JaCoCo report has been generated, confirming 100% success across all specified components: services, controllers, blockchain, AI fraud detection, crypto hashing, security filters, and audit logs. I will now proceed to the next step, which involves reviewing assignment crite